{"id":"650dc4b8018183d7","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-finite-subtheory.md","title":"Code Bounded Axiom Fragment","display":"df-finite-subtheory — Code Bounded Axiom Fragment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-finite-subtheory","aliases":["67-df-finite-subtheory"],"display":"df-finite-subtheory — Code Bounded Axiom Fragment","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-consistency-statement]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-formula]]"],"source_scope":"第 1 章，印刷页 18；PDF 第 29 页；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 80–81；PDF 第 91–92 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-finite-subtheory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-finite-subtheory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-subtheory — Code Bounded Axiom Fragment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 1 章，印刷页 18；PDF 第 29 页；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 80–81；PDF 第 91–92 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 为有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是公理代码变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\varphi_F\">\\(\\vec\\varphi_F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_F\">\\(\\sigma_F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_F\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_F\\)</span> 在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigvee\\)</span> 的空列和递归取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一证明演算和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}\\)</span> 图公式族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为其指定的结论代码变量。有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_F\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_F\\)</span> 在下式固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_F}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_F}\\)</span>，并据此使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_g\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_g\\)</span>，不另选同外延表示。代码截断作用于公理，不作用于证明或定理集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec\\varphi_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}^{|F|}\\\n[\\{\\varphi_i:i&lt;|F|\\}=F\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|F|\\ (g(\\varphi_i)&lt;g(\\varphi_j))],\\\\\n\\sigma_F(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle z=\\overline{g((\\vec\\varphi_F)_i)}\\rangle_{i&lt;|F|},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_F(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_F}(v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_F)=\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_F},\\\\\nS\\upharpoonright k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in S:g(\\varphi)\\le k\\},\\\\\nS&amp;=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}S\\upharpoonright k,\n&amp;|S\\upharpoonright k|&amp;\\le k+1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec\\varphi_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}^{|F|}\\\n[\\{\\varphi_i:i&lt;|F|\\}=F\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|F|\\ (g(\\varphi_i)&lt;g(\\varphi_j))],\\\\\n\\sigma_F(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle z=\\overline{g((\\vec\\varphi_F)_i)}\\rangle_{i&lt;|F|},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_F(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_F}(v),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_F)=\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_F},\\\\\nS\\upharpoonright k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in S:g(\\varphi)\\le k\\},\\\\\nS&amp;=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}S\\upharpoonright k,\n&amp;|S\\upharpoonright k|&amp;\\le k+1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书印刷页 18（PDF 第 29 页）写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\upharpoonright k=\\{n\\in X:n\\le k\\}\">\\(X\\upharpoonright k=\\{n\\in X:n\\le k\\}\\)</span>；本轮核对图像纠正旧稿将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 误读为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的来源偏差，基数界同步改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k+1\">\\(k+1\\)</span>。此处把句法对象和代码分开。代码有界片段是有限公理集，能在任意有限公理使用范围上取充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这是 Orey–Hájek 与 Orey 紧致性所需的穷竭片段，不是“只准用小代码证明”的有限一致性测试。来源定义已核对。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 1 章，印刷页 18；PDF 第 29 页；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 80–81；PDF 第 91–92 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-go